## Session Logging

{% if tool.name == 'claude' %}@codegen/rules/_core/session-log.md
{% else %}→ See `codegen/rules/_core/session-log.md` for format.
{% endif %}

**WHERE**: `codegen/logging/$(date -u +%Y%m%d_%H%M%S)_session.md`

Each invocation creates NEW log file. Create it with `codegen-log init --slug <slug>` BEFORE delegating to planner. The writer stamps the Version Stamp inline and does not pre-seed role headers.

```markdown
# Session Log

**Started**: $(date -u)
**Task**: [What you're doing]

## Version Stamp

- harness: $(git rev-parse --short HEAD 2>/dev/null || echo unknown)
- codegen: $(git -C ./codegen/rules rev-parse --short HEAD 2>/dev/null || echo unknown)
{% if tool.name == 'claude' %}- claude: $(claude --version 2>/dev/null || echo unknown)
{% else %}- pi: $(pi --version 2>/dev/null || echo unknown)
{% endif %}- stamped_at: $(date -u +%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ)

## Rules Loaded

- [x] codegen/PROJECT_CONTEXT.md
- [x] codegen/rules/roles/orchestrator.md

## Plan

⛔ ORCHESTRATOR: Do NOT write anything here. This section is filled in by the planner subagent ONLY.
Spawn the stack planner subagent — `planner-phoenix` (Phoenix) or `planner-static` (static) — now. NEVER spawn the built-in `Plan`. Do not write a plan. Do not write bullet points. Do not write phases.

## Delegation Timeline

| Time | Agent | Task | Result |
| ---- | ----- | ---- | ------ |

## Files Modified

- [ ] [list files as subagents modify them]
```
